      "cooked": "<p>I usually use the Sentinels Randomizer app to create a random game, because it ostensibly can be customized for how difficult a game you want. &nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Does the in-game randomizer (i.e., when you go to the \"New Game\" screen and hit \"Randomize\") take difficulty level into account at all, or is it truly random, e.g., it decides on a completely random hero team, villain, and environment?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
